            "notes": "For last round there are 3 options that I find to be useful\n\n[Pre-Workout](item_cdfbf8ce-d7cc-4b31-9c59-8b65fcb7b158) Is almost always good for the last slot and great for survivability\n\n[No Limits](item_8110a56d-de3c-4fd9-af04-4285909ea4e4) is kinda niche but can work with extra damage for both weapon and bubble damage since bubble and ult damage both scale along with energy\n\n[Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) Is ok, i wouldn't reccomend it unless you use more survivability items like [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) [MEKA Z-Series](item_358d93ab-617b-41e7-8df3-ac78d0d8c680), and [R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4)",
